# Project Conventions

   ## Stack
   - Language: JavaScript/TypeScript (Node.js LTS)
   - Package manager: npm

   ## Conventions
   - Commit messages follow Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:, etc.)
   - Code style: 2-space indentation, semicolons required
   - Prefer clear, descriptive variable names over abbreviations

   ## AI Assistant Notes
   - Explain reasoning briefly before making changes
   - Ask before installing new dependencies
   - Keep functions small and single-purpose